    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Congratulations, you\u2019ve landed a job as a 'Dungeon QA tester'. Your employer - a cat with a questionable sense of humor, who\u2019s turned chaos into a business model. Here, spells are your lifeline and arcane missiles come in unrelenting waves. As a <strong>Spellweaver</strong>, you\u2019ll craft custom spells, dodge bullet-hell nightmares, and try not to give the Dungeon Architect any reason to doubt your credentials.\u00a0Wishlist <strong>spellloom</strong> now to stay updated on the latest developments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's see what your new employer has to say.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587900/extras/8fa429be74fc41d352de65d7b8600ad2.poster.avif?t=1748804805\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587900/extras/8fa429be74fc41d352de65d7b8600ad2.webm?t=1748804805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587900/extras/8fa429be74fc41d352de65d7b8600ad2.mp4?t=1748804805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587900/extras/d562fd9124690af57119e5ee5785414c.poster.avif?t=1748804805\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587900/extras/d562fd9124690af57119e5ee5785414c.webm?t=1748804805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587900/extras/d562fd9124690af57119e5ee5785414c.mp4?t=1748804805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, <strong>Combat</strong>. Hope you enjoy weaving through a storm of magical projectiles - because that's basically your life now.\u00a0Concentrated action. Every encounter is a chaotic ballet of fireballs, lasers, and creatures with entirely too many teeth. You'll dodge, you'll shoot, and maybe you'll even survive. Try to look confident out there; I find panic so boring.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crafting &amp; Spellweaving</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587900/extras/e6b149010872019381cb6ef515c28803.poster.avif?t=1748804805\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587900/extras/e6b149010872019381cb6ef515c28803.webm?t=1748804805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587900/extras/e6b149010872019381cb6ef515c28803.mp4?t=1748804805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You want to play with magic? Fine. I've given you the <strong>Spellbinder</strong> \u2013 a fancy grimoire that lets you stitch spells together however you like. Slot in shiny spell components (<i>Essences, Aspects... big words, I know</i>) to customize your two spells on the fly. Think chain lightning, AoE bursts, bouncing shots, or protective shields - whatever magical concoctions you piece together. Go on, impress me with your little experiments (and try not to set yourself on fire in the process).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587900/extras/9742ee540ed94edf09e3839d54c801d9.poster.avif?t=1748804805\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587900/extras/9742ee540ed94edf09e3839d54c801d9.webm?t=1748804805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587900/extras/9742ee540ed94edf09e3839d54c801d9.mp4?t=1748804805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>My dungeon is ever-changing (I'm indecisive, so what?). No two runs are the same, so don't bother memorizing layouts. You\u2019ll wander through shadowy halls, enchanted rooms, and whatever other corridors I dream up to keep things interesting. Some of them might even help you out - find a secret or a shop and consider it a courtesy before the next onslaught. It's challenging, but I'm not trying to crush your spirit in one go; if you die too fast, I'd have to find a new tester.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well, that's the tour. Off you go, <strong>Spellweaver</strong>\u00a0- the dungeon won't test itself. I suppose I could wish you luck, but honestly... it makes no difference to me.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Congratulations, you\u2019ve landed a job as a 'Dungeon QA tester'. Your employer - a cat with a questionable sense of humor, who\u2019s turned chaos into a business model. Here, spells are your lifeline and arcane missiles come in unrelenting waves. As a <strong>Spellweaver</strong>, you\u2019ll craft custom spells, dodge bullet-hell nightmares, and try not to give the Dungeon Architect any reason to doubt your credentials.\u00a0Wishlist <strong>spellloom</strong> now to stay updated on the latest developments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's see what your new employer has to say.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587900/extras/8fa429be74fc41d352de65d7b8600ad2.poster.avif?t=1748804805\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587900/extras/8fa429be74fc41d352de65d7b8600ad2.webm?t=1748804805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587900/extras/8fa429be74fc41d352de65d7b8600ad2.mp4?t=1748804805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587900/extras/d562fd9124690af57119e5ee5785414c.poster.avif?t=1748804805\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587900/extras/d562fd9124690af57119e5ee5785414c.webm?t=1748804805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587900/extras/d562fd9124690af57119e5ee5785414c.mp4?t=1748804805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, <strong>Combat</strong>. Hope you enjoy weaving through a storm of magical projectiles - because that's basically your life now.\u00a0Concentrated action. Every encounter is a chaotic ballet of fireballs, lasers, and creatures with entirely too many teeth. You'll dodge, you'll shoot, and maybe you'll even survive. Try to look confident out there; I find panic so boring.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crafting &amp; Spellweaving</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587900/extras/e6b149010872019381cb6ef515c28803.poster.avif?t=1748804805\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587900/extras/e6b149010872019381cb6ef515c28803.webm?t=1748804805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587900/extras/e6b149010872019381cb6ef515c28803.mp4?t=1748804805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You want to play with magic? Fine. I've given you the <strong>Spellbinder</strong> \u2013 a fancy grimoire that lets you stitch spells together however you like. Slot in shiny spell components (<i>Essences, Aspects... big words, I know</i>) to customize your two spells on the fly. Think chain lightning, AoE bursts, bouncing shots, or protective shields - whatever magical concoctions you piece together. Go on, impress me with your little experiments (and try not to set yourself on fire in the process).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587900/extras/9742ee540ed94edf09e3839d54c801d9.poster.avif?t=1748804805\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587900/extras/9742ee540ed94edf09e3839d54c801d9.webm?t=1748804805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587900/extras/9742ee540ed94edf09e3839d54c801d9.mp4?t=1748804805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>My dungeon is ever-changing (I'm indecisive, so what?). No two runs are the same, so don't bother memorizing layouts. You\u2019ll wander through shadowy halls, enchanted rooms, and whatever other corridors I dream up to keep things interesting. Some of them might even help you out - find a secret or a shop and consider it a courtesy before the next onslaught. It's challenging, but I'm not trying to crush your spirit in one go; if you die too fast, I'd have to find a new tester.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well, that's the tour. Off you go, <strong>Spellweaver</strong>\u00a0- the dungeon won't test itself. I suppose I could wish you luck, but honestly... it makes no difference to me.</p>",
    "short_description": "spellloom is a roguelike bullet-hell dungeon crawler with deep spell-building. Play as a Spellweaver\u2014an intrepid QA tester employed by a cynical Dungeon Architect\u2014and brave his chaotic creation. Prepare for fierce Combat, creative Spell Crafting, and perilous Exploration in the ever-shifting Void.",
